WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:37.500
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:37.770 --> 01:42.990
[Shadow Punisher]

3
01:43.080 --> 01:43.680
[Divine Constable Tally]

4
01:43.680 --> 01:45.930
[Episode 16]

5
01:55.509 --> 01:56.310
Look.

6
01:57.120 --> 01:59.450
Something's not right about this ledger.

7
02:03.380 --> 02:05.210
[Actual Profit: 9,300 taels]

8
02:06.320 --> 02:07.790
[Actual Profit: 6,900 taels]

9
02:07.790 --> 02:09.470
It's so perfectly preserved—

10
02:10.080 --> 02:10.710
you'd think

11
02:10.710 --> 02:12.710
it had just fallen from the heavens.

12
02:15.590 --> 02:17.120
What do you two mean by that?

13
02:18.000 --> 02:19.380
I worked so hard

14
02:19.410 --> 02:20.540
to find this ledger.

15
02:23.240 --> 02:24.710
Actually, when I found it,

16
02:24.710 --> 02:25.710
I suspected

17
02:25.920 --> 02:28.079
someone had deliberately left it behind.

18
02:28.079 --> 02:29.630
Do you know what this means?

19
02:30.280 --> 02:31.710
It means even Heaven

20
02:31.710 --> 02:33.280
couldn't tolerate Ji Ada!

21
02:45.750 --> 02:46.560
Look.

22
02:51.310 --> 02:53.400
If the poison were on the silver hairpin,

23
02:53.400 --> 02:55.150
the hairpin should've turned black.

24
02:55.150 --> 02:55.960
Exactly.

25
02:56.310 --> 02:57.910
So it wasn't the hairpin.

26
02:58.150 --> 02:58.950
And Ji Ada's

27
02:58.970 --> 03:00.080
stab wound

28
03:00.080 --> 03:01.870
shows no blackening or swelling,

29
03:01.870 --> 03:02.680
which means the poison

30
03:02.680 --> 03:03.580
didn't enter his body

31
03:03.580 --> 03:05.000
through the wound either.

32
03:05.000 --> 03:08.240
So Old Madam Gong didn't administer the poison.

33
03:09.310 --> 03:10.520
Now that's strange.

34
03:10.910 --> 03:12.710
We all saw it last night.

35
03:15.080 --> 03:16.630
Well, do you think the poison

36
03:16.630 --> 03:18.590
was administered before Old Madam Gong struck,

37
03:18.590 --> 03:19.960
or after?

38
03:23.680 --> 03:24.710
It must've been after.

39
03:24.710 --> 03:25.520
Right.

40
03:25.630 --> 03:27.680
Otherwise, it'd be hard to control when the poison took effect.

41
03:27.680 --> 03:28.910
If the victim suddenly collapsed

42
03:28.910 --> 03:30.310
halfway through the investigation,

43
03:30.310 --> 03:32.520
the killer would risk exposing themselves.

44
03:32.520 --> 03:33.750
Master!

45
03:43.610 --> 03:44.740
Divine Constables!

46
03:44.910 --> 03:45.800
Divine Constables,

47
03:45.800 --> 03:46.660
terrible news.

48
03:46.840 --> 03:49.000
Gong Le committed suicide by swallowing gold!

49
03:49.000 --> 03:49.800
What?

50
04:08.520 --> 04:09.780
From this day forward,

51
04:10.310 --> 04:11.520
there will never be

52
04:12.280 --> 04:14.540
a Gong banner flying on these seas again.

53
04:22.680 --> 04:22.750
Hurry up, move it!

54
04:22.750 --> 04:23.950
[Mingling County]

55
04:24.600 --> 04:25.390
Okay.

56
04:25.870 --> 04:28.070
Make sure the straw mat is thick enough.

57
04:28.630 --> 04:29.430
Boatman,

58
04:29.510 --> 04:30.680
are you sailing today?

59
04:30.680 --> 04:31.510
No, no.

60
04:31.530 --> 04:32.860
Put it here. Put it here.

61
04:35.560 --> 04:36.360
Boatman,

62
04:36.680 --> 04:37.940
are you sailing today?

63
04:38.870 --> 04:39.870
Forgive me, ma'am.

64
04:39.870 --> 04:41.510
Old Madam Gong passed away 2 days ago,

65
04:41.510 --> 04:42.680
so we all agreed

66
04:42.680 --> 04:43.870
not to go to sea for 3 days

67
04:43.870 --> 04:45.270
as a gesture of mourning.

68
04:45.480 --> 04:46.270
Triple.

69
04:46.430 --> 04:48.000
I'll pay you triple the fare.

70
04:48.000 --> 04:49.070
Just take me out to sea.

71
04:49.070 --> 04:50.800
So what if you're rich?

72
04:50.800 --> 04:51.820
Back in the day, every ship on this sea

73
04:51.820 --> 04:53.420
belonged to the Gong family.

74
04:54.190 --> 04:55.870
It's not that we don't want to earn money.

75
04:55.870 --> 04:57.930
It's the rule of the Boatmen's Guild.

76
04:58.830 --> 04:59.630
Five times.

77
05:00.870 --> 05:01.680
Ten times!

78
05:01.680 --> 05:03.830
Boatman, I'll pay you 10 times the fare!

79
05:03.830 --> 05:04.630
Boatman!

80
05:06.190 --> 05:07.510
In the end, the Gong family

81
05:07.510 --> 05:09.840
stopped their enemy with their own hands.

82
05:11.000 --> 05:12.800
This is truly the will of Heaven.

83
05:15.510 --> 05:16.570
Divine Constable,

84
05:16.720 --> 05:17.680
a few days ago,

85
05:17.870 --> 05:19.920
a distant aunt of mine passed away,

86
05:20.190 --> 05:22.870
and I'm in a hurry to go back for the funeral.

87
05:23.270 --> 05:24.600
Go back for the funeral?

88
05:25.630 --> 05:26.430
I'd say

89
05:27.270 --> 05:28.680
the place you're hurrying to

90
05:28.680 --> 05:30.680
is where the Ji family's dirty money

91
05:30.720 --> 05:31.680
from smuggling government salt

92
05:31.680 --> 05:33.360
is hidden.

93
05:34.310 --> 05:35.430
Divine Constable,

94
05:35.430 --> 05:36.950
you must be joking.

95
05:37.040 --> 05:38.590
How could the Ji family's

96
05:38.800 --> 05:41.260
ill-gotten fortune possibly be in my hands?

97
05:41.390 --> 05:42.950
You were able to

98
05:43.310 --> 05:44.570
take Master Ji's life.

99
05:45.040 --> 05:47.770
Taking his money would hardly be more difficult.

100
05:56.830 --> 05:58.010
Master!

101
05:58.870 --> 06:01.200
Please look into this carefully, My Lord!

102
06:01.800 --> 06:03.660
I advise you not to try any tricks.

103
06:04.070 --> 06:05.870
Even if you slip away from me,

104
06:06.310 --> 06:08.000
the Severe-Cold Sword is still

105
06:08.000 --> 06:09.460
waiting for you out there.

106
06:21.000 --> 06:23.360
Whether Lord Meng is waiting out there or not,

107
06:23.360 --> 06:24.120
you came here alone

108
06:24.120 --> 06:26.050
after all, Young Master Qingyang.

109
06:26.310 --> 06:27.120
I take it

110
06:27.720 --> 06:29.450
you have something to say to me.

111
06:29.510 --> 06:30.270
Clever.

112
06:30.800 --> 06:31.630
Let me ask you.

113
06:33.120 --> 06:33.980
You were the one

114
06:34.720 --> 06:36.580
who found the stand-in for Ji Ada.

115
06:36.720 --> 06:38.000
You were the one

116
06:38.120 --> 06:39.550
who ordered the massacre of the Gong family.

117
06:39.550 --> 06:40.000
[Rice Shop]

118
06:40.000 --> 06:41.120
It was also you

119
06:41.390 --> 06:43.870
who pulled the strings behind the government salt smuggling.

120
06:43.870 --> 06:45.670
You were sent by the First Prince

121
06:45.720 --> 06:47.560
to keep an eye on Ji Ada.

122
06:48.510 --> 06:49.510
Is your real name

123
06:50.120 --> 06:51.480
Xiuniang

124
06:52.510 --> 06:53.870
or Xiu Wei?

125
06:55.800 --> 06:56.870
Who are you?

126
07:01.480 --> 07:03.010
In the 20th year of Hongyun,

127
07:03.270 --> 07:05.270
you held a post in the Ministry of War

128
07:05.270 --> 07:07.330
and sent out a false military report.

129
07:07.680 --> 07:10.360
After that, you came to Mingling County

130
07:10.830 --> 07:13.240
and continued working for the First Prince,

131
07:13.240 --> 07:15.270
keeping watch on the Gong and Ji families'

132
07:15.270 --> 07:17.000
smuggling of government salt.

133
07:19.830 --> 07:21.510
In this country, you need a travel permit

134
07:21.510 --> 07:22.630
wherever you go.

135
07:24.070 --> 07:25.400
Young Master Qingyang,

136
07:25.870 --> 07:27.630
did you find the travel permit?

137
07:28.830 --> 07:30.120
Naturally not.

138
07:31.430 --> 07:33.040
At the end of the day,

139
07:33.430 --> 07:35.510
everything you said is just speculation.

140
07:35.510 --> 07:36.570
That's because...

141
07:38.630 --> 07:41.159
you were born in Mingling County in Qingzhou.

142
07:42.240 --> 07:43.770
You came to Mingling County

143
07:44.270 --> 07:47.070
not to escape trouble or to conduct official business,

144
07:47.070 --> 07:48.159
but to return home.

145
07:49.720 --> 07:51.120
Under the Great Shi Code,

146
07:51.120 --> 07:52.830
returning to one's hometown requires no travel permit.

147
07:52.830 --> 07:53.630
So,

148
07:54.040 --> 07:54.870
there was never

149
07:54.870 --> 07:56.830
a Xiu Wei from Tianhuang City.

150
07:57.040 --> 07:58.300
From beginning to end,

151
07:58.720 --> 08:00.120
there was only

152
08:00.120 --> 08:02.050
Xiuniang returning home in glory.

153
08:03.240 --> 08:05.310
They say you're charming and gallant

154
08:05.600 --> 08:07.360
and especially gentle with women.

155
08:07.360 --> 08:08.160
Besides,

156
08:08.870 --> 08:10.420
what I left behind for you

157
08:11.430 --> 08:12.920
will surely keep me alive,

158
08:12.920 --> 08:13.630
won't it?

159
08:15.310 --> 08:16.120
Looks like

160
08:17.190 --> 08:18.120
you'd planned

161
08:18.120 --> 08:19.720
a way out for yourself long ago.

162
08:19.720 --> 08:20.600
I still have to thank you

163
08:20.600 --> 08:22.130
on behalf of the people here

164
08:22.630 --> 08:24.860
for the ledger you left behind

165
08:25.070 --> 08:26.360
in the fire.

166
08:27.270 --> 08:27.950
Your Divine Constable Bureau

167
08:27.950 --> 08:29.510
will need a witness,

168
08:30.240 --> 08:31.310
and that witness

169
08:32.080 --> 08:33.669
has to be alive, right?

170
08:33.669 --> 08:34.799
Rest assured, Miss.

171
08:35.080 --> 08:38.409
The Divine Constable Bureau will definitely keep you safe.

172
08:39.330 --> 08:40.799
Divine Constable,

173
08:40.840 --> 08:42.960
could it be that you want me to testify

174
08:44.840 --> 08:46.510
as a witness and expose everything

175
08:46.510 --> 08:48.440
the First Prince did 17 years ago?

176
08:50.200 --> 08:52.260
Who are you to the late Fourth Prince?

177
08:53.240 --> 08:54.080
I only need you

178
08:54.080 --> 08:56.480
to tell me what you know about the smuggling of government salt.

179
08:56.480 --> 08:57.270
As for

180
08:58.120 --> 08:59.520
what the First Prince did

181
08:59.670 --> 09:01.200
in the 20th year of Hongyun,

182
09:04.510 --> 09:06.310
it isn't time to reveal that yet.

183
09:15.000 --> 09:15.840
Jiuying,

184
09:16.870 --> 09:17.670
Gong Le...

185
09:19.100 --> 09:20.670
won't be coming back.

186
09:21.860 --> 09:22.120
♪ A solitary boat dividing left and right ♪

187
09:22.120 --> 09:23.150
Why?

188
09:23.630 --> 09:24.840
Probably because

189
09:26.000 --> 09:27.130
he wouldn't be happy

190
09:28.080 --> 09:29.170
if he came back here.

191
09:29.170 --> 09:31.480
♪ Amidst the vast, misty waters, they sail toward the surging tide ♪

192
09:31.480 --> 09:32.550
Now that he's gone,

193
09:34.000 --> 09:35.600
he'll never be beaten again.

194
09:36.890 --> 09:38.790
♪ The rust of old memories feels like a waking dream ♪

195
09:38.790 --> 09:41.000
He'll never be beaten again...

196
09:42.390 --> 09:43.440
Then will I

197
09:44.490 --> 09:44.750
♪ It hurts to let go, but I'm holding tightly to emptiness ♪

198
09:44.750 --> 09:48.670
ever see him again?

199
09:51.240 --> 09:52.070
You will.

200
09:52.070 --> 09:53.670
♪ Should we meet across mountains and seas ♪

201
09:53.670 --> 09:54.670
One day,

202
09:55.440 --> 09:56.010
you will see each other again.

203
09:56.010 --> 09:58.670
♪ If the long road leads to no return ♪

204
09:58.670 --> 09:59.480
We...

205
09:59.710 --> 10:01.080
♪ If I can't travel with you in this life ♪

206
10:01.080 --> 10:02.510
will all meet again.

207
10:06.390 --> 10:07.200
Jiuying.

208
10:07.520 --> 10:08.240
♪ If the lights in my heart ♪

209
10:08.240 --> 10:09.640
Let me ask you something.

210
10:09.670 --> 10:10.870
Do you still remember

211
10:11.450 --> 10:11.480
♪ Become old marks with the falling snow ♪

212
10:11.480 --> 10:13.480
where that cave full of bugs

213
10:13.790 --> 10:14.670
is?

214
10:39.030 --> 10:40.670
How much longer will it take?

215
10:40.840 --> 10:42.480
We've never tested it

216
10:42.480 --> 10:43.480
on animals before,

217
10:43.480 --> 10:44.360
but it's already

218
10:44.360 --> 10:46.030
begun to change.

219
10:46.360 --> 10:48.910
If it can really mutate into a demon wolf,

220
10:50.240 --> 10:51.910
then Liluo's great cause

221
10:53.200 --> 10:55.080
will be unstoppable.

222
10:56.480 --> 10:57.270
Yes.

223
11:07.360 --> 11:08.390
Wolfie, Wolfie.

224
11:08.870 --> 11:09.670
Wolfie.

225
11:11.150 --> 11:11.870
It's me.

226
11:12.000 --> 11:12.670
Wolfie,

227
11:12.750 --> 11:14.270
it's me. Don't be afraid.

228
12:01.270 --> 12:03.400
That beast has successfully mutated.

229
12:03.550 --> 12:05.260
The demon wolf belongs to Liluo!

230
12:05.260 --> 12:06.840
No matter where you run,

231
12:06.870 --> 12:08.360
we will find you!

232
12:09.000 --> 12:10.390
I see.

233
12:12.090 --> 12:13.090
So

234
12:13.930 --> 12:15.960
those glowing bugs

235
12:16.410 --> 12:17.480
are Chiying bugs.

236
12:20.440 --> 12:21.480
How vile.

237
12:22.730 --> 12:24.800
They want to mutate not only humans

238
12:25.480 --> 12:27.720
but also beasts.

239
12:27.910 --> 12:28.720
Jiuying,

240
12:29.390 --> 12:30.150
can you take us

241
12:30.150 --> 12:31.270
to that cave?

242
12:39.030 --> 12:39.840
Let's go in.

243
13:00.390 --> 13:01.600
They're all dead.

244
13:08.240 --> 13:09.390
According to what you've told us,

245
13:09.390 --> 13:10.480
Liluo used the venom of Chiying bugs

246
13:10.480 --> 13:11.480
to mutate humans.

247
13:11.760 --> 13:12.660
Then these

248
13:12.840 --> 13:14.600
should be the test subjects from the demon-men experiments.

249
13:14.600 --> 13:15.270
But for some reason,

250
13:15.270 --> 13:16.670
the experiments failed.

251
13:20.320 --> 13:21.120
Look,

252
13:21.240 --> 13:22.240
these blood spots

253
13:22.600 --> 13:24.730
should be from the venomous bug bites.

254
13:29.180 --> 13:30.900
What strange markings.

255
13:32.200 --> 13:33.240
Be careful, all of you.

256
13:33.240 --> 13:34.840
Don't get bitten by the bugs,

257
13:34.840 --> 13:36.970
or else even I won't be able to cure you.

258
13:37.840 --> 13:39.390
This is extremely cruel.

259
13:40.030 --> 13:42.150
Those poor innocent people...

260
13:44.360 --> 13:45.480
Lou Tianming knew

261
13:45.720 --> 13:47.650
we would come here sooner or later.

262
13:48.200 --> 13:50.110
These failed subjects were a burden,

263
13:50.110 --> 13:51.560
so he left them here.

264
14:17.550 --> 14:18.670
What are these?

265
14:27.040 --> 14:28.370
They're so badly drawn.

266
14:28.600 --> 14:29.670
Even my drawings

267
14:30.240 --> 14:31.720
would be better than theirs.

268
14:31.720 --> 14:32.630
Only those

269
14:32.790 --> 14:34.790
cultists who treat human lives as nothing

270
14:34.790 --> 14:36.720
would worship

271
14:36.720 --> 14:38.200
such grotesque evil gods.

272
14:48.840 --> 14:50.030
Did you get bitten?

273
14:53.440 --> 14:54.240
It's nothing,

274
14:54.720 --> 14:56.070
just one sting.

275
14:56.790 --> 14:58.030
I've been bitten

276
14:58.120 --> 14:59.390
by these tiny little bugs several times already.

277
14:59.390 --> 15:01.390
They won't poison people so easily.

278
15:07.030 --> 15:07.840
Li Si.

279
15:08.770 --> 15:10.120
-Li Si! -Li Si!

280
15:10.120 --> 15:11.120
-Qingyang. -Li Si!

281
15:11.120 --> 15:11.790
Are you alright?

282
15:11.790 --> 15:13.430
-Qingyang! -Li Si!

283
16:12.320 --> 16:13.120
Li Si.

284
16:16.120 --> 16:16.910
Zhenzhu...

285
16:18.390 --> 16:19.250
Zhenzhu.

286
16:19.390 --> 16:21.390
Li Si. Li Si!

287
16:27.390 --> 16:28.240
Qingyang.

288
16:35.200 --> 16:36.000
You're awake.

289
16:38.030 --> 16:39.160
How are you feeling?

290
16:39.720 --> 16:40.980
You're finally awake.

291
16:41.630 --> 16:42.490
How do you feel?

292
16:45.390 --> 16:46.240
Zhenzhu...

293
16:46.440 --> 16:47.240
I'm here.

294
16:49.340 --> 16:50.270
Yan.

295
16:50.750 --> 16:51.680
Are you alright?

296
16:56.320 --> 16:57.630
Come on, get up.

297
17:02.910 --> 17:03.840
How do you feel?

298
17:04.030 --> 17:04.880
Are you okay?

299
17:09.310 --> 17:10.440
What happened to me?

300
17:11.200 --> 17:12.829
You were poisoned by a Chiying bug.

301
17:12.829 --> 17:14.310
I've already drawn out the poisoned blood.

302
17:14.310 --> 17:15.589
But normally,

303
17:15.589 --> 17:17.000
with only one bite,

304
17:17.000 --> 17:18.440
the poison shouldn't have been

305
17:18.440 --> 17:19.480
this severe.

306
17:19.920 --> 17:20.720
Right.

307
17:21.349 --> 17:22.829
I was bitten several times too.

308
17:22.829 --> 17:23.829
Why am I fine?

309
17:24.349 --> 17:25.160
Could it be

310
17:25.829 --> 17:27.890
that they're not the same kind of bug?

311
17:28.440 --> 17:29.240
Strange.

312
17:30.830 --> 17:32.550
This is clearly my old ailment—

313
17:32.550 --> 17:34.000
the burning in my heart meridians—

314
17:34.000 --> 17:35.540
flaring up again.

315
17:36.350 --> 17:38.400
Could the Chiying bug venom

316
17:38.400 --> 17:40.380
have triggered it?

317
17:42.400 --> 17:44.550
And this time,

318
17:45.030 --> 17:46.640
it's worse than ever.

319
17:49.640 --> 17:51.270
If only my master were here.

320
18:08.440 --> 18:09.700
Lord Constable Ghost,

321
18:10.110 --> 18:11.710
I've heard so much about you.

322
18:11.720 --> 18:12.790
Who are you?

323
18:13.410 --> 18:15.550
Why did you break into the county office in the middle of the night?

324
18:15.550 --> 18:17.410
It's all for the half-dead fellow

325
18:17.790 --> 18:19.500
in there.

326
18:19.700 --> 18:21.300
You guys may not feel for him,

327
18:21.400 --> 18:22.680
but as his master,

328
18:22.680 --> 18:24.440
my heart aches for him.

329
18:41.440 --> 18:42.400
You brat,

330
18:42.920 --> 18:44.520
can you stop making me worry?

331
18:44.960 --> 18:46.030
Don't you know the state

332
18:46.030 --> 18:47.200
of your own body?

333
18:48.120 --> 18:49.220
Stop talking.

334
18:49.310 --> 18:50.480
You stop talking!

335
18:51.790 --> 18:53.450
Focus on circulating your qi.

336
18:56.590 --> 18:58.250
Your qi and blood are in chaos.

337
19:01.960 --> 19:04.560
I've managed to suppress it for the time being.

338
19:06.830 --> 19:07.640
You brat.

339
19:09.310 --> 19:09.960
I can't

340
19:09.960 --> 19:11.360
be at your side every day.

341
19:11.750 --> 19:12.830
What will you do next time

342
19:12.830 --> 19:13.590
this happens?

343
19:13.590 --> 19:14.520
What will you do?

344
19:16.030 --> 19:17.630
I still have a few pills here.

345
19:18.830 --> 19:20.360
Keep them for emergencies.

346
19:21.830 --> 19:23.310
Take better care of yourself.

347
19:23.310 --> 19:24.400
Don't push yourself so hard.

348
19:24.400 --> 19:24.830
Otherwise,

349
19:24.830 --> 19:26.660
I really don't know which of us will have to bury the other!

350
19:26.660 --> 19:27.790
Got it.

351
19:32.470 --> 19:33.270
Wait,

352
19:34.000 --> 19:35.110
he's fine now?

353
19:35.720 --> 19:36.880
Look at him now.

354
19:36.880 --> 19:38.210
Does he look fine to you?

355
19:39.510 --> 19:41.040
I really don't understand.

356
19:41.960 --> 19:43.680
He's a newcomer.

357
19:44.000 --> 19:45.070
Seniors, please.

358
19:45.440 --> 19:47.350
He's a rookie!

359
19:47.590 --> 19:48.400
You seniors,

360
19:48.400 --> 19:50.510
please take good care of him!

361
19:51.000 --> 19:51.790
Please.

362
19:52.160 --> 19:52.960
I'm off.

363
19:56.510 --> 19:57.310
Meng Rui,

364
19:58.110 --> 19:59.350
he's my master.

365
19:59.590 --> 20:00.550
May I ask

366
20:01.110 --> 20:02.110
why you're able to cure

367
20:02.110 --> 20:03.170
Chiying bug venom?

368
20:04.400 --> 20:05.200
First of all,

369
20:05.790 --> 20:06.550
I don't know

370
20:06.550 --> 20:08.750
what "Chiying bug venom" is.

371
20:09.400 --> 20:10.160
Secondly,

372
20:11.030 --> 20:13.960
this disciple of mine has always been in poor health.

373
20:14.160 --> 20:15.400
Whatever ails him,

374
20:15.590 --> 20:16.830
that's what I treat.

375
20:16.830 --> 20:18.590
What did you give him just now?

376
20:18.720 --> 20:19.920
A Resurrection Pill.

377
20:20.310 --> 20:21.350
Its other name

378
20:21.350 --> 20:23.080
may sound more familiar to you:

379
20:23.510 --> 20:26.680
the All-Nourishing Pill.

380
20:28.440 --> 20:29.400
My Lords,

381
20:30.030 --> 20:31.070
to be honest,

382
20:31.550 --> 20:32.960
I have an old illness.

383
20:33.550 --> 20:34.550
For some reason,

384
20:35.000 --> 20:36.310
the Chiying bug venom

385
20:36.830 --> 20:37.790
seems to have triggered

386
20:37.790 --> 20:39.200
it.

387
20:39.960 --> 20:41.110
Just now, my master

388
20:41.440 --> 20:43.440
was only treating my old illness.

389
20:45.510 --> 20:46.960
No need to make a fuss.

390
20:46.960 --> 20:48.200
No wonder

391
20:48.640 --> 20:49.640
I was fine.

392
20:50.030 --> 20:52.030
Turns out you're just frail.

393
20:52.550 --> 20:53.720
Then I'm relieved.

394
20:56.920 --> 20:58.240
His pulse is indeed less alarming

395
20:58.240 --> 20:59.370
than it was earlier.

396
21:01.200 --> 21:02.000
Forgive my rudeness.

397
21:02.000 --> 21:02.960
Not at all.

398
21:02.960 --> 21:03.960
I lost

399
21:03.960 --> 21:05.720
my composure a little earlier too,

400
21:05.720 --> 21:07.750
especially toward you, Lord Constable Ghost.

401
21:07.750 --> 21:08.920
Please don't take it to heart.

402
21:08.920 --> 21:09.990
I'm off!

403
21:10.200 --> 21:11.330
No need to see me out.

404
21:14.830 --> 21:16.230
Please excuse my master.

405
21:29.960 --> 21:31.030
As they say,

406
21:31.510 --> 21:33.030
the wicked never die.

407
21:33.400 --> 21:33.480
It's only been 3 days,

408
21:33.480 --> 21:35.310
[Coroner's Office]

409
21:35.310 --> 21:37.510
and you're up and running around again.

410
21:39.000 --> 21:40.130
That's all thanks to

411
21:40.440 --> 21:42.270
you, Sanhuo.

412
21:45.160 --> 21:46.030
My Lords.

413
21:52.420 --> 21:53.730
Are you alright now?

414
21:56.550 --> 21:57.350
I'm fine now.

415
21:57.750 --> 21:58.720
Are you alright?

416
22:01.180 --> 22:02.160
Let me see.

417
22:02.440 --> 22:03.510
It's my failure

418
22:03.530 --> 22:04.620
as a local official

419
22:04.750 --> 22:06.810
that this child has suffered so much.

420
22:06.920 --> 22:09.160
I leave her in your hands now.

421
22:09.590 --> 22:10.590
Take her to Tianhuang City more often

422
22:10.590 --> 22:11.830
and let her see more of the world,

423
22:11.830 --> 22:14.360
so she can make something of herself someday.

424
22:14.990 --> 22:17.590
[Coroner's Office]

425
22:24.200 --> 22:25.000
Someone

426
22:25.400 --> 22:27.880
once asked me to take her out

427
22:28.550 --> 22:30.400
to see the world too.

428
22:30.480 --> 22:31.270
Alright.

429
22:31.590 --> 22:32.400
Child,

430
22:32.750 --> 22:33.640
come with us.

431
22:34.880 --> 22:36.290
Want some? Not giving you any.

432
22:36.290 --> 22:36.920
Jiuying,

433
22:36.920 --> 22:37.720
-ignore him. -Does your master

434
22:37.720 --> 22:39.120
follow you on every case?

435
22:39.480 --> 22:40.550
I can see you two

436
22:40.880 --> 22:42.590
have a deep bond as master and disciple.

437
22:42.590 --> 22:43.400
Honestly,

438
22:43.420 --> 22:45.570
-I was really lucky this time -Yan, stop teasing her.

439
22:45.570 --> 22:47.170
that my master happened to be

440
22:47.200 --> 22:48.240
nearby.

441
22:49.670 --> 22:50.770
Still,

442
22:51.680 --> 22:53.880
it really was too much of a coincidence.

443
22:54.440 --> 22:56.100
I've told you about my master.

444
22:56.350 --> 22:57.230
Why don't you tell me

445
22:57.230 --> 22:58.200
about yours?

446
23:00.680 --> 23:02.480
He's just a wandering martial artist,

447
23:02.480 --> 23:04.080
not as famous as your master.

448
23:04.640 --> 23:06.720
There's nothing much to say about him.

449
23:06.720 --> 23:07.750
Then tell me

450
23:08.240 --> 23:10.570
why he knows how to cure Chiying bug venom.

451
23:13.720 --> 23:15.440
Didn't I tell you already?

452
23:15.640 --> 23:16.880
The Chiying bugs are tiny,

453
23:16.880 --> 23:18.240
and they can only inject a limited amount of venom.

454
23:18.240 --> 23:19.480
One sting

455
23:19.480 --> 23:21.080
isn't enough to do much harm.

456
23:21.110 --> 23:23.830
Your life would be in danger

457
23:24.010 --> 23:25.870
only if you were chased and bitten

458
23:26.310 --> 23:28.550
by a swarm of them for 3 days and nights.

459
23:31.070 --> 23:32.550
Like Sanhuo,

460
23:32.920 --> 23:35.240
I was poisoned only a little.

461
23:35.830 --> 23:37.070
I just don't know

462
23:37.590 --> 23:39.000
why that little bit

463
23:40.030 --> 23:42.030
happened to trigger my old illness.

464
23:47.830 --> 23:48.640
Meng Rui,

465
23:49.720 --> 23:50.480
you're not seriously

466
23:50.480 --> 23:52.210
suspecting my master, are you?

467
23:52.270 --> 23:53.750
I think those Chiying bugs

468
23:53.750 --> 23:55.070
have messed with your head.

469
23:55.070 --> 23:57.070
You think everyone is connected to the demon-men.

470
23:57.070 --> 23:58.330
Isn't it a coincidence

471
23:58.550 --> 23:59.270
that the Chiying bug venom

472
23:59.270 --> 24:01.670
just happened to trigger your old illness?

473
24:02.440 --> 24:04.000
Well, among all the people

474
24:04.110 --> 24:07.170
in this vast world, why did we happen to become friends?

475
24:07.270 --> 24:08.920
It's all fate,

476
24:08.920 --> 24:10.640
arranged by Heaven.

477
24:11.480 --> 24:13.680
So what if there are a few coincidences?

478
24:14.880 --> 24:15.640
How did you and your master

479
24:15.640 --> 24:16.720
meet?

480
24:18.790 --> 24:20.310
My master went up the mountain to gather herbs,

481
24:20.310 --> 24:21.400
mistook me for ginseng,

482
24:21.400 --> 24:23.030
and dug me out of the ground!

483
24:23.350 --> 24:24.160
You...

484
24:26.160 --> 24:26.960
Li Si!

485
24:29.090 --> 24:31.680
[Tianshu Pavilion]

486
24:32.380 --> 24:34.830
[Qipi, God of Lies]

487
24:48.270 --> 24:49.720
God of Lies,

488
24:50.710 --> 24:51.840
Qipi...

489
24:53.900 --> 24:56.840
[Star-Gathering Pavilion]

490
24:56.870 --> 24:58.780
[Great Shi Treasure Notes]

491
25:08.920 --> 25:12.240
Someone wants to smuggle government salt across the Two Rivers and Three Provinces?

492
25:12.240 --> 25:13.920
It's an inviolable rule in our Great Shi Dynasty:

493
25:13.920 --> 25:15.920
salt and iron are the foundation of the state,

494
25:15.920 --> 25:17.460
and government salt must never be sold privately.

495
25:17.460 --> 25:18.990
What are you talking about?

496
25:20.730 --> 25:22.290
But I heard that

497
25:22.920 --> 25:25.000
someone really is smuggling government salt.

498
25:25.000 --> 25:25.790
Outrageous!

499
25:25.960 --> 25:26.680
Then why hasn't your Divine Constable Bureau

500
25:26.680 --> 25:27.960
arrested him yet?

501
25:29.790 --> 25:31.850
But that person is of imperial blood.

502
25:32.150 --> 25:33.480
He's of imperial blood?

503
25:35.590 --> 25:36.400
Who?

504
25:38.640 --> 25:39.840
You may speak freely.

505
25:44.480 --> 25:46.720
The First Prince, Zhou Miao.

506
25:47.270 --> 25:48.320
Zhou Miao?

507
25:50.240 --> 25:52.500
Zhou Miao is smuggling government salt?

508
25:54.480 --> 25:55.310
Impossible.

509
25:56.000 --> 25:57.200
How could he have the nerve

510
25:57.200 --> 25:58.240
to break this iron law?

511
25:58.240 --> 25:59.550
He'd have to be insane!

512
26:00.240 --> 26:01.640
It's absolutely true.

513
26:20.240 --> 26:22.350
Li Qingyang, you're not lying to me?

514
26:37.270 --> 26:38.070
These are

515
26:38.110 --> 26:41.070
the letters between the First Prince and the Ji family of Mingling County,

516
26:41.070 --> 26:43.200
along with their ledgers.

517
26:44.200 --> 26:46.130
Please take a look, Your Highness.

518
26:51.280 --> 26:51.480
[Actual Profit: 9,300 taels]

519
26:51.500 --> 26:57.510
[Actual Profit: 6,900 taels]

520
27:28.240 --> 27:29.700
Please calm down, Father.

521
27:30.240 --> 27:32.680
It appears that the First Prince has pocketed illicit gains,

522
27:32.680 --> 27:34.110
bent the law,

523
27:34.440 --> 27:36.310
smuggled government salt, and colluded

524
27:36.310 --> 27:38.200
with people outside the palace.

525
27:39.680 --> 27:40.440
However, my elder brother

526
27:40.440 --> 27:42.070
must've had a momentary lapse in judgment,

527
27:42.070 --> 27:43.960
and it led to such a grave offense.

528
27:46.200 --> 27:48.030
Father, you're wise and discerning.

529
27:48.030 --> 27:49.890
I implore you,

530
27:50.030 --> 27:51.680
in light of my elder brother's

531
27:51.680 --> 27:53.790
long-standing reputation as a virtuous prince

532
27:53.790 --> 27:55.920
and his contributions to the country,

533
27:56.030 --> 27:57.720
to show him leniency.

534
28:11.880 --> 28:12.790
Xiao Ning.

535
28:16.720 --> 28:17.780
Yes, Your Majesty.

536
28:18.070 --> 28:21.000
What do you say, on behalf of the Ministry of Justice?

537
28:21.240 --> 28:24.170
I shall look into the matter fairly and impartially.

538
28:25.270 --> 28:26.110
Do it, then.

539
28:26.480 --> 28:27.540
Yes, Your Majesty.

540
28:27.880 --> 28:30.070
If the Crown Prince's report proves true,

541
28:30.070 --> 28:31.530
there will be no leniency.

542
28:33.880 --> 28:34.680
But...

543
28:35.640 --> 28:38.040
we mustn't wrong the First Prince, either.

544
28:38.760 --> 28:40.110
The evidence is irrefutable.

545
28:40.110 --> 28:41.710
What is left to investigate?

546
28:41.720 --> 28:43.590
I meant for you to look up the penal code!

547
28:43.590 --> 28:45.030
Where there is precedent, follow it.

548
28:45.030 --> 28:47.270
Where there is none, treat him no differently from a commoner!

549
28:47.270 --> 28:48.070
Guo Anbang!

550
28:48.400 --> 28:49.460
Yes, Your Majesty.

551
28:51.070 --> 28:51.880
Yes.

552
28:56.640 --> 28:58.040
Hear the imperial edict!

553
29:00.270 --> 29:04.440
By the Mandate of Heaven, the Emperor decrees:

554
29:06.320 --> 29:08.670
Zhou Miao is by nature mediocre

555
29:08.880 --> 29:10.600
and has no merit to his name.

556
29:11.200 --> 29:13.070
He has abused his authority for private gain

557
29:13.070 --> 29:14.830
and is unfit for his post.

558
29:15.440 --> 29:18.030
He has squandered

559
29:18.070 --> 29:19.730
his once-worthy reputation,

560
29:20.510 --> 29:22.270
harming governance and damaging the public good.

561
29:22.270 --> 29:23.930
What justification remains?

562
29:24.920 --> 29:26.310
If such conduct goes unpunished,

563
29:26.310 --> 29:28.120
how can the law ever be upheld?

564
29:29.010 --> 29:30.710
His official titles and ranks

565
29:30.880 --> 29:32.790
shall be stripped.

566
29:33.310 --> 29:36.170
From today on, his princely title shall be revoked,

567
29:36.790 --> 29:38.830
and he shall be confined within the palace

568
29:38.830 --> 29:40.920
so that we may see whether he reforms.

569
29:42.000 --> 29:43.630
Thus decreed!

570
29:44.480 --> 29:46.020
We obey the imperial edict.

571
29:46.880 --> 29:50.440
His Majesty also has an oral decree.

572
29:51.110 --> 29:54.440
"I've heard that the four newly promoted Divine Constables

573
29:54.920 --> 29:56.640
are all exceptionally talented and courageous,

574
29:56.640 --> 29:58.750
with outstanding wisdom and strategy.

575
29:58.750 --> 30:01.200
I cherish worthy people

576
30:01.590 --> 30:04.200
and wish to honor their loyalty and diligence at once.

577
30:04.200 --> 30:06.880
Summon them for an audience at the palace!"

578
30:13.440 --> 30:15.160
Constable Iron, Yan Sanhuo,

579
30:15.510 --> 30:18.000
you go through hell and high water to catch criminals,

580
30:18.000 --> 30:20.800
and the blade in your hand flashes like lightning.

581
30:21.440 --> 30:23.000
You come from an aristocratic family.

582
30:23.000 --> 30:24.480
Three generations of your family have served the country well.

583
30:24.480 --> 30:26.140
I'm well aware of your merits.

584
30:27.880 --> 30:28.750
Meng Rui,

585
30:29.440 --> 30:31.240
it is said that in Tianhuang City,

586
30:31.240 --> 30:32.830
children who are not crying

587
30:32.830 --> 30:34.270
burst into tears in fear

588
30:34.270 --> 30:36.000
the moment they hear your name,

589
30:36.030 --> 30:37.070
and those who are crying

590
30:37.070 --> 30:38.510
stop immediately.

591
30:39.110 --> 30:41.880
And your Reaper Sword— those who see it know misfortune is near.

592
30:41.880 --> 30:43.750
But I never imagined

593
30:44.030 --> 30:45.240
that you, Constable Ghost,

594
30:45.240 --> 30:47.790
would be such a handsome young man.

595
30:52.270 --> 30:53.160
Zhenzhu,

596
30:53.720 --> 30:55.880
I held you when you were a child,

597
30:55.920 --> 30:58.580
and now you've grown into a graceful young lady.

598
30:59.400 --> 31:00.350
You should've

599
31:00.350 --> 31:01.830
married into my family long ago,

600
31:01.830 --> 31:03.960
if it hadn't been for what happened...

601
31:17.790 --> 31:18.830
All of you

602
31:19.480 --> 31:21.070
are outstanding.

603
31:21.440 --> 31:23.030
Having you around

604
31:23.310 --> 31:24.070
suddenly makes me feel

605
31:24.070 --> 31:25.830
several years younger myself.

606
31:25.830 --> 31:27.230
No need for formalities.

607
31:27.270 --> 31:28.400
Rise, all of you.

608
31:28.510 --> 31:29.960
Thank you, Your Majesty.

609
31:33.350 --> 31:34.160
One.

610
31:34.960 --> 31:35.750
Two.

611
31:36.750 --> 31:37.550
Three.

612
31:44.310 --> 31:45.550
Your Majesty,

613
31:45.640 --> 31:47.110
that fellow Li Qingyang—

614
31:48.550 --> 31:49.350
no,

615
31:50.200 --> 31:51.310
Divine Constable Qingyang—

616
31:51.310 --> 31:52.830
said he had an upset stomach

617
31:52.830 --> 31:54.790
and simply couldn't hold it in

618
31:54.830 --> 31:56.400
right before the audience.

619
32:01.310 --> 32:02.270
Your Majesty,

620
32:02.680 --> 32:03.480
he...

621
32:05.310 --> 32:08.000
He said he was afraid of breaching court etiquette in front of Your Majesty,

622
32:08.000 --> 32:09.530
so he would be a little late.

623
32:09.880 --> 32:10.680
Yes.

624
32:11.440 --> 32:12.440
Your Majesty,

625
32:12.440 --> 32:13.110
we searched

626
32:13.110 --> 32:15.270
the entire privy from top to bottom earlier,

627
32:15.270 --> 32:17.000
but we just couldn't find Li Si.

628
32:47.880 --> 32:48.680
Your Majesty,

629
32:49.000 --> 32:50.880
although Li Si meant

630
32:50.880 --> 32:51.880
no disrespect,

631
32:51.880 --> 32:53.440
he has indeed disregarded proper decorum

632
32:53.440 --> 32:54.440
and behaved recklessly.

633
32:54.440 --> 32:55.240
Once we return,

634
32:55.240 --> 32:56.590
I will report this to our Chief

635
32:56.590 --> 32:57.640
and make sure he is properly disciplined.

636
32:57.640 --> 32:59.200
Alright, alright.

637
33:00.000 --> 33:01.600
This isn't a court assembly.

638
33:01.680 --> 33:03.030
I invited you here

639
33:03.030 --> 33:03.720
just to see

640
33:03.720 --> 33:05.850
the finest young talents of our realm.

641
33:06.030 --> 33:07.550
That's why I asked you here

642
33:07.590 --> 33:09.070
to have tea as guests.

643
33:09.640 --> 33:10.440
What?

644
33:10.880 --> 33:12.110
The guest doesn't show up,

645
33:12.110 --> 33:14.710
and the host is supposed to hold it against him?

646
33:26.270 --> 33:27.070
Eunuch Guo,

647
33:27.720 --> 33:30.550
you seem to want to say something.

648
33:31.510 --> 33:32.760
It's been a long time

649
33:33.070 --> 33:35.690
since I last saw Your Majesty smile.

650
33:46.680 --> 33:48.980
I was laughing at Li Qingyang.

651
33:52.310 --> 33:54.640
Do you remember the autumn hunt that year?

652
33:55.470 --> 33:56.470
The Crown Prince,

653
33:56.680 --> 33:57.830
the First Prince, and the Third Prince

654
33:57.830 --> 33:59.630
were all dressed and ready to go.

655
33:59.640 --> 34:01.920
Only Yan was still hitching up his trousers,

656
34:01.920 --> 34:04.200
also claiming he needed to relieve himself.

657
34:04.200 --> 34:05.000
As a result,

658
34:05.310 --> 34:06.510
all the court officials

659
34:06.510 --> 34:08.190
waited for him for a while.

660
34:10.000 --> 34:11.360
Some tactless censor

661
34:11.400 --> 34:12.440
had the nerve to say

662
34:12.440 --> 34:14.630
that Yan had behaved improperly.

663
34:16.280 --> 34:17.230
He was angling for a reputation

664
34:17.230 --> 34:19.090
as a fearless, outspoken censor.

665
34:19.630 --> 34:20.800
And he dared to

666
34:20.920 --> 34:23.110
set his sights on my son to do it.

667
34:25.440 --> 34:26.440
Do you remember

668
34:27.480 --> 34:29.360
what I said at the time?

669
34:30.320 --> 34:31.630
Your Majesty said,

670
34:33.920 --> 34:34.760
"Lord Liu,

671
34:35.440 --> 34:36.670
nature's call waits for no man.

672
34:36.670 --> 34:38.070
I now command you

673
34:38.230 --> 34:40.440
not to use the privy for 7 days and nights.

674
34:40.440 --> 34:43.300
Hold it in until you've squeezed out some decorum!"

675
34:45.460 --> 34:47.780
[Uphold Virtue and Good Morals]

676
34:58.280 --> 35:00.070
If anyone in this world dares to bully

677
35:00.070 --> 35:01.550
my Yan,

678
35:02.150 --> 35:04.070
I will chop off his head.

679
35:04.480 --> 35:05.280
Then...

680
35:05.590 --> 35:06.710
what if it were you

681
35:06.710 --> 35:08.320
who wronged me?

682
35:27.280 --> 35:29.150
I broke my promise.

683
35:30.630 --> 35:32.070
Xuanyuan Shan was right.

684
35:34.670 --> 35:36.960
Even if I could choose again,

685
35:39.070 --> 35:41.070
I would still do the same.

686
35:41.840 --> 35:42.640
Your Majesty,

687
35:44.320 --> 35:45.830
everything you did

688
35:47.590 --> 35:49.630
was for the country.

689
35:51.230 --> 35:54.030
His Highness the Fourth Prince would understand.

690
35:57.280 --> 36:00.590
[Uphold Virtue and Good Morals]

691
36:02.070 --> 36:03.590
I want to walk alone.

692
36:04.480 --> 36:05.590
Don't follow me.

693
36:07.630 --> 36:08.440
Your Majesty.

694
36:09.670 --> 36:10.480
Your Majesty!

695
36:50.560 --> 36:54.500
♪ Night deepens, spreading like ink over rivers and mountains ♪

696
36:56.800 --> 37:00.860
♪ I'm a spark that refuses to die ♪

697
37:02.530 --> 37:07.420
♪ Riding the wind, a thousand years pass in a fleeting moment ♪

698
37:08.610 --> 37:13.780
♪ Seeking the song left unsung ♪

699
37:15.140 --> 37:20.260
♪ Fleeting light fades like fragile promises ♪

700
37:21.360 --> 37:26.900
♪ Who softly sings along from the far shore? ♪

701
37:27.450 --> 37:32.680
♪ I'm the poem that keeps summer nights awake ♪

702
37:33.600 --> 37:34.590
♪ I'm amber that defies the passage of time ♪

703
37:34.590 --> 37:36.190
Your Highness, you mustn't!

704
37:36.670 --> 37:37.440
Well...

705
37:38.280 --> 37:39.070
Father.

706
37:39.190 --> 37:39.800
Yan.

707
37:39.800 --> 37:40.000
♪ A fleeting glimmer entwines with eternity ♪

708
37:40.000 --> 37:40.760
Come on.

709
37:41.440 --> 37:42.670
Come to me.

710
37:43.590 --> 37:44.400
Father,

711
37:45.190 --> 37:46.410
you have gray hair.

712
37:46.410 --> 37:47.670
♪ Illuminating the stillness of the Milky Way ♪

713
37:47.670 --> 37:49.150
I'm getting old.

714
37:49.190 --> 37:50.550
Having some gray hair

715
37:50.590 --> 37:52.070
is nothing to be surprised at.

716
37:52.070 --> 37:53.800
As long as a man achieves great things,

717
37:53.800 --> 37:55.880
what does gray hair matter?

718
37:56.400 --> 37:57.190
No, no.

719
37:57.190 --> 37:57.590
♪ Gracefully dancing and tracing the contours of a dream ♪

720
37:57.590 --> 37:59.280
If you have gray hair,

721
37:59.280 --> 38:01.000
when others bully me in the future,

722
38:01.000 --> 38:01.880
you won't be able

723
38:01.880 --> 38:02.910
to stand up for me.

724
38:02.910 --> 38:03.550
♪ Falling into the water, stirring ripples that dance and glimmer ♪

725
38:03.550 --> 38:04.280
If anyone

726
38:04.280 --> 38:06.880
in this world dares to bully my Yan,

727
38:07.800 --> 38:08.730
I will chop off his head.

728
38:08.730 --> 38:11.510
♪ Whose eyes are reflected in this humble flame? ♪

729
38:11.510 --> 38:14.150
Yan, did I hurt you?

730
38:14.950 --> 38:15.760
♪ Stirring waves of turmoil within his heart ♪

731
38:15.760 --> 38:16.550
Then...

732
38:16.710 --> 38:17.920
what if it were you

733
38:17.920 --> 38:19.510
who wronged me?

734
38:22.070 --> 38:22.800
You ungrateful little thing.

735
38:22.800 --> 38:24.400
♪ The past is as fragile as dew upon wings ♪

736
38:24.400 --> 38:25.280
I care about you

737
38:25.280 --> 38:26.010
more than anything.

738
38:26.010 --> 38:26.400
♪ To fall is, in its own way, to be free ♪

739
38:26.400 --> 38:27.860
How could I ever wrong you?

740
38:28.440 --> 38:30.230
Even if I were wronged,

741
38:30.230 --> 38:31.320
it wouldn't matter.

742
38:31.320 --> 38:34.050
All I want is for you not to have gray hair, Father.

743
38:35.110 --> 38:40.150
♪ I'm the poem that keeps summer nights awake ♪

744
38:41.060 --> 38:43.670
♪ I'm amber that defies the passage of time ♪

745
38:43.670 --> 38:44.960
What should we do?

746
38:45.440 --> 38:47.270
Those hairs insist on growing gray.

747
38:47.270 --> 38:47.400
♪ A fleeting glimmer entwines with eternity ♪

748
38:47.400 --> 38:49.190
What can I do?

749
38:49.320 --> 38:50.110
Father,

750
38:50.320 --> 38:51.440
from now on,

751
38:51.480 --> 38:53.510
every time you grow a gray hair,

752
38:53.670 --> 38:53.700
I'll pluck it for you.

753
38:53.700 --> 38:59.280
♪ Rewrite the loneliness of time and space ♪

754
39:00.270 --> 39:00.480
♪ Let longing become ♪

755
39:00.480 --> 39:01.280
Alright.

756
39:01.670 --> 39:02.710
I allow it.

757
39:02.840 --> 39:05.440
An emperor never breaks his word. Pinky swear.

758
39:05.510 --> 39:05.640
An emperor never breaks his word.

759
39:05.640 --> 39:06.630
♪ Every word whispered on the wind ♪

760
39:06.630 --> 39:07.840
I promise you.

761
39:12.880 --> 39:13.670
Come on.

762
39:13.670 --> 39:15.110
Come to me.

763
39:15.110 --> 39:15.880
Okay!

764
39:21.670 --> 39:22.630
Careful, careful.

765
39:22.630 --> 39:23.440
Leave it to me.

766
39:23.440 --> 39:24.370
Come on, come on.

767
39:30.560 --> 39:32.480
[Great Shi Treasure Notes]

768
39:33.320 --> 39:34.580
The Crown Prince said,

769
39:34.590 --> 39:37.720
"After you, Zhao Shanlei, joined the Divine Constable Bureau,

770
39:37.720 --> 39:40.380
the wanted criminal Lou Tianming ran away.

771
39:40.880 --> 39:43.070
Look at Li Qingyang.

772
39:43.190 --> 39:44.110
He joined the Divine Constable Bureau

773
39:44.110 --> 39:46.840
and immediately helped me bring down Zhou Miao."

774
39:49.440 --> 39:51.360
Li Qingyang, Li Qingyang,

775
39:51.440 --> 39:52.400
you're now

776
39:52.400 --> 39:53.840
the role model for all of us servants

777
39:53.840 --> 39:55.440
in the Eastern Palace.

778
39:56.670 --> 39:58.840
The Crown Prince can't wait to reward you.

779
39:58.840 --> 40:01.240
Why do you still need to go out of your way...

780
40:01.730 --> 40:02.490
to curry favor?

781
40:02.490 --> 40:04.270
[Great Shi Treasure Notes]

782
40:06.670 --> 40:07.760
This money

783
40:08.440 --> 40:10.240
isn't a gift for the Crown Prince

784
40:10.630 --> 40:12.110
but for you.

785
40:16.030 --> 40:17.760
The Crown Prince also said

786
40:17.920 --> 40:19.720
that once he ascends the throne,

787
40:21.030 --> 40:22.440
he'll have you

788
40:22.440 --> 40:24.500
take over Xuanyuan Shan's position.

789
40:24.880 --> 40:27.080
Tell me, the money from the future Chief

790
40:27.280 --> 40:29.080
of the Divine Constable Bureau—

791
40:29.710 --> 40:31.840
how could a servant like me

792
40:32.430 --> 40:34.440
dare to accept it?

793
40:35.880 --> 40:36.670
Eunuch,

794
40:37.070 --> 40:39.150
once the Crown Prince ascends the throne,

795
40:39.150 --> 40:39.960
won't you

796
40:40.630 --> 40:42.920
become the Head Eunuch of the imperial palace?

797
40:42.920 --> 40:43.670
Just like

798
40:43.670 --> 40:45.230
Lord Guo Anbang is now—

799
40:45.670 --> 40:47.130
second only to the Emperor

800
40:47.440 --> 40:48.840
and above everyone else.

801
40:51.670 --> 40:52.480
How

802
40:52.920 --> 40:54.760
could I not rely on you?

803
40:55.030 --> 40:55.880
Well...

804
40:58.630 --> 41:00.890
That's not something to say carelessly.

805
41:02.670 --> 41:03.550
Eunuch,

806
41:04.920 --> 41:05.920
only if you

807
41:06.590 --> 41:07.920
accept this money

808
41:07.920 --> 41:09.840
can I feel at ease.

809
41:10.230 --> 41:11.280
Think about it:

810
41:11.320 --> 41:13.320
only if you, the future Head Eunuch,

811
41:13.630 --> 41:16.030
accept a small bribe from me

812
41:17.030 --> 41:18.630
will you pay more attention

813
41:19.710 --> 41:21.030
to my affairs.

814
41:30.710 --> 41:32.320
Well, well, Li Qingyang.

815
41:32.670 --> 41:34.600
You want to hold something over me?

816
41:37.280 --> 41:38.190
Remember,

817
41:39.440 --> 41:40.510
if I accept a bribe,

818
41:41.590 --> 41:43.650
then you are the one who offered it.

819
41:44.430 --> 41:46.160
Bribing an imperial eunuch...

820
41:46.630 --> 41:47.880
Isn't that perfect?

821
41:48.030 --> 41:48.840
That way,

822
41:49.480 --> 41:51.140
you also have something on me,

823
41:51.440 --> 41:53.190
Eunuch.

824
41:57.880 --> 42:00.140
Exchanging pledges of loyalty like this

825
42:00.190 --> 42:02.440
makes us true brothers, right?

826
42:08.230 --> 42:09.210
Eunuch.

827
42:10.280 --> 42:11.880
Let's leave the future aside

828
42:11.880 --> 42:13.110
and talk about now.

829
42:13.670 --> 42:15.720
Nothing stays hidden forever.

830
42:16.280 --> 42:17.030
I'm guessing

831
42:17.630 --> 42:19.510
Xuanyuan Shan will find out sooner or later

832
42:19.510 --> 42:20.800
that it was me who told the Crown Prince

833
42:20.800 --> 42:21.950
about the government salt affair.

834
42:21.950 --> 42:22.840
I'm sure

835
42:23.440 --> 42:24.920
she'll give me a hard time.

836
42:25.670 --> 42:27.880
Who does Xuanyuan Shan think she is?

837
42:29.590 --> 42:30.800
No need to wait.

838
42:31.230 --> 42:32.840
Let's settle the score right now.
